  Program developed for time-dependent transport in nanostructures at the Technical University of Denmark (DTU).

  Please cite this article:
       @article{zandpackref,
         title={Zandpack: A General Tool for Time-dependent 
                Transport Simulation of Nanoelectronics},
         author={Lorentzen, Aleksander Bach and Croy, Alexander and 
                 Jauho, Antti-Pekka and Brandbyge, Mads},
         journal={Computer Physics Communications},
